      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.0,
      "text": "I'm dead, I'm holding you"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.0,
      "end": 14.0,
      "text": "Something pulling from beneath the wall"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.0,
      "end": 19.0,
      "text": "We call it way, we call it fate"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.0,
      "end": 25.0,
      "text": "We never name it what it is"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.0,
      "end": 28.0,
      "text": "Every hand grips something small"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.0,
      "end": 31.0,
      "text": "Quite thread, a subtle call"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.0,
      "end": 34.0,
      "text": "We dress it up in better names"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.0,
      "end": 36.0,
      "text": "Routine relief for just the way"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.0,
      "end": 39.0,
      "text": "A sip to soften sharp in days"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.0,
      "end": 42.0,
      "text": "A screen to keep the dark at bay"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.0,
      "end": 44.0,
      "text": "A voice that says you're doing fine"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.0,
      "end": 47.0,
      "text": "While tying knots we never find"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.0,
      "end": 50.0,
      "text": "We say we're free, we say we choose"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.0,
      "end": 53.0,
      "text": "But we know things we never lose"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.0,
      "end": 56.0,
      "text": "It's not a change enough to make us fight"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.0,
      "end": 58.0,
      "text": "Just enough to feel like right"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.0,
      "end": 61.0,
      "text": "It doesn't bruise, it doesn't scream"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.0,
      "end": 64.0,
      "text": "It settles in between the scenes"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.0,
      "end": 66.0,
      "text": "A gentle pull you learned to trust"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.0,
      "end": 69.0,
      "text": "Until we forget it's there at all"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.0,
      "end": 75.0,
      "text": "We are thirsty, drinking ties"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.0,
      "end": 77.0,
      "text": "Something that we try to hide"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.0,
      "end": 81.0,
      "text": "Every cure just pulls us under slow devotion"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.0,
      "end": 84.0,
      "text": "Just as a wonder what we carry"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.0,
      "end": 88.0,
      "text": "What we blame, what we swear is in our way"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.0,
      "end": 91.0,
      "text": "It's the way that keeps us here"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.0,
      "end": 94.0,
      "text": "I saltwater anchor crystal clear"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.0,
